<p>As for the testing: get more than one person/adult on the merry-go-round to confirm that the same people look yellow and it's not different for each viewer. Once that's confirmed, give <em>everyone who's had contact with it</em> an extensive battery of physical &amp; psychological tests. Isolate aspects of the yellow/orange/red people that are statistically abnormal from the rest of the testees. Confirm that these aspects are universal across the &quot;warning&quot; people, and identify that the intensity of the psychosexual abnormalities matches with the color. Bam! (potential) child predators identified.</p>

