														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2084090">
									

<p>I think the paedophile/bulling/etc. is rather contrived. I would've preferred it to be some other kind of alternate lens of a spinning kaleidoscope of some other reality just under the surface of our own, an offering from that reality to our own in the form of a gift to our most precious offspring&#8230;</p>
<p>But eh, I guess an asshole-detector is OK too. Neutral vote.</p>

							</div>

