			<div class="content" id="post-content-2084302">
									

<p>Awww, oh well. Funnily enough, that was the very, very first thought I had for this SCP, but I quickly moved on because I figured that had probably been done and didn't feel original enough for me.</p>
<p>The next idea I had was that this SCP was allowing kids to see the effects of another, completely different SCP. So this SCP itself wouldn't have been terribly notable, with the hook being it leads to the discovery of a different one after the Foundation figure it out.</p>
<p>Then I remembered hearing how there was a disproportionate amount of sex offenders living around the university campus, and the (now closed) elementary school near it, in my city. That gave me enough inspiration to flesh out the current idea into a complete article so I went with it.</p>

